) Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34256989\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7655-4833\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0009102 \"A specialized, fibroblastic reticular cell of mesenchymal origin found in lymph nodes. In human, it expresses several markers common to myofibroblasts (desmin, vimentin, CD73, CD90, α-smooth muscle actin (αSMA)), and can be differentiated from endothelial cells by its lack of CD31 expression. These cells are critical for the overall organization and function of the lymph node. Lymph node fibroblastic reticular cells (FRCs) can be further classified based on their location, function, and unique marker expression.\")\n24203:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym obo:CL_0009102 \"fibroblastic reticular cell\")\n24204:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0009102 \"lymph node fibroblastic reticular cell\")\n24210:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:21435450\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:22566825\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25998961\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:28262465\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29752062\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34256989\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7655-4833\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0009103 \"A fibroblastic reticular cell found in the lymph node subcapsular sinus.\")\n24222:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:21435450\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:22566825\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25998961\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:28262465\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29752062\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34256989\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7655-4833\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0009104 \"A fibroblastic reticular cell found in the lymph node germinal center dark zone (B cell zone).\")\n24226:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0009104 \"lymph node germinal center d